Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.58,0:00:02.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.48,0:00:04.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新的一集马上要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.85,0:00:06.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了找齐四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.75,0:00:08.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了用这把铁碎牙打败奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.02,0:00:10.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,家乡与家人全被歼灭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.72,0:00:12.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弟弟琥珀又落在奈落的手中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.36,0:00:15.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过不管珊瑚多么灰心失意
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.23,0:00:16.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最贴心的小猫 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.03,0:00:18.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,始终陪在她的身边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.86,0:00:20.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师加上珊瑚 七宝跟云母
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:22.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿梭于时空 发生在战国时代与现代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:23.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.10,0:00:31.13,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分散在蓝蓝天空上的 七颗星星{\fad(300,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.98,0:00:35.67,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每一颗星星 都刻着我的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.08,0:00:39.68,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算梦想被粉碎 我也要寻找爱{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.89,0:00:43.69,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无处可逃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.99,0:00:47.58,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紧紧抓着我的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.89,0:00:55.82,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些骗人的光阴 我再也不会输给它{\fad(0,600)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.27,0:01:01.47,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睁大眼睛 看清楚这瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.77,0:01:05.68,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它仍然紧紧围绕着我们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.08,0:01:09.67,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让人啜泣的 现实生活中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.92,0:01:13.82,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最重要的…到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.15,0:01:17.38,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繁忙的这个世界{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.66,0:01:21.62,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永恒的碎片 忽隐又忽现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.93,0:01:25.62,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去触摸 去捕捉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.93,0:01:32.30,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要循着目标继续向前走{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.94,0:01:37.60,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了得到最后的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.91,0:01:44.82,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要循着目标继续向前走{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.00,0:02:01.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟随我们同行的云母
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:04.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一只有两条尾巴的叉尾猫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.51,0:02:07.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要战斗的时候 它会变得非常大
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.31,0:02:09.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还可以在空中自由飞来飞去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.68,0:02:12.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,平时它却是一只非常可爱的小猫咪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.25,0:02:14.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母的脾气非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.88,0:02:16.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算大家对它不好 它也是逆来顺受
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.39,0:02:19.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过必要时
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:21.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好也让大家知道一下 你也是有脾气的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.46,0:02:22.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.96,0:02:30.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第97话 云母为什么没回家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.98,0:02:52.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.04,0:02:55.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们有没有人看见云母
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.08,0:02:57.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没看见耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.38,0:02:58.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.38,0:02:59.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.12,0:03:02.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天一早起来就没有看到它了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.59,0:03:04.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该不会出去散步了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.86,0:03:07.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是云母从来不会不说一声就自己跑出去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.89,0:03:09.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是离家出走了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.30,0:03:12.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会不会正在发情啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.37,0:03:14.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看恐怕是叛逆期
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.67,0:03:16.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在胡说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.04,0:03:19.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让珊瑚更加担心了怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.14,0:03:23.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过昨天云母看起来真的没有什么异常
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.54,0:03:27.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过溜出去逛逛 不需要大惊小怪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.15,0:03:27.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.81,0:03:30.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果连这种事也要瞎操心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.18,0:03:33.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们岂不是要忙得不可开交了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.39,0:03:34.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就别管它了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.02,0:03:35.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等它玩够了自然会回来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.19,0:03:38.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是这样就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.02,0:03:40.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别太担心了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.56,0:03:42.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母又不是小孩子了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.59,0:03:43.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过咧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.30,0:03:46.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换了是别的小孩子 就又另当别论了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.53,0:03:47.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说也是有道理啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.17,0:03:51.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这什么意思 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.50,0:03:53.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我哪有什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.84,0:03:55.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里就只有你一个小孩子而已嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.91,0:03:58.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇姑娘 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.61,0:04:00.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,烤鱼已经可以吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.55,0:04:01.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.89,0:04:13.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁说云母马上就会回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.00,0:04:25.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在连个影子都没看到嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.17,0:04:27.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你少罗唆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.37,0:04:28.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我哪知道它什么时候回来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.87,0:04:29.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说这什么话啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.31,0:04:32.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明自己说过的话 这么快就忘光啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.88,0:04:36.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么 臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.45,0:04:38.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.02,0:04:40.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到外面去找云母
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.02,0:04:42.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.26,0:04:45.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这样漫无目的到处找
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.46,0:04:46.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕也毫无头绪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.63,0:04:50.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是由犬夜叉上场吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.26,0:04:54.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个 是要干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.20,0:04:56.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是云母吃饭的盘子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.77,0:04:58.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开猫罐头喂它的时候用的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.97,0:05:01.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拿这个给我要干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.34,0:05:03.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为你最好闻清楚盘子里的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.28,0:05:06.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母身上的味道我会不知道吗？ 哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.71,0:05:10.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好加油 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.79,0:05:19.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样？闻出来了没有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.66,0:05:23.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 味道在途中消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.06,0:05:26.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只爬了三步就不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.80,0:05:29.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.50,0:05:30.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是大家分头找好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.00,0:05:32.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过没用啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.87,0:05:33.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母的味道突然消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.94,0:05:35.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就表示它飞上空中了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.14,0:05:36.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更何况
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.94,0:05:39.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这附近根本就没有它的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.44,0:05:40.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.58,0:05:42.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也不能够什么事都不做对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.25,0:05:45.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一点我当然懂
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.38,0:05:46.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.45,0:05:47.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.95,0:05:49.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有什么线索可以参考
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.46,0:05:52.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比方说你跟云母吵过架啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.89,0:05:55.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或是云母是不是附近有认识的朋友啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.69,0:05:56.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仔细想想总会有吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.40,0:05:59.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这样问我我也不知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.90,0:06:01.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么细节都可以哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.47,0:06:02.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比方说吃东西没有胃口啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.10,0:06:04.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近脾气特别古怪啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.84,0:06:08.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者是附近出现了一些野猫
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.54,0:06:12.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道说…或许是因为我害的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.91,0:06:15.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没有理会云母的感受
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.35,0:06:17.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次都让云母卷入我跟妖怪的决斗之中
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.28,0:06:21.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要到远方去 我就理所当然的骑着它上路
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.29,0:06:24.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从来没有奖励赞美过它
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.62,0:06:25.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就连它最喜欢吃的鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.06,0:06:28.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也没有常常给它吃
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.73,0:06:31.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 别太责怪自己
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.36,0:06:33.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母不会为了这些事离家出走的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.80,0:06:34.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.63,0:06:37.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.64,0:06:39.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想到云母为什么离家出走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.07,0:06:40.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.94,0:06:43.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为刚刚犬夜叉欺负我才让我想起来的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.94,0:06:44.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.74,0:06:46.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要随便想想就可以知道原因何在了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.15,0:06:49.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底为什么？你快说 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.32,0:06:51.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母它…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.95,0:06:56.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母是因为犬夜叉还有你们害的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.52,0:06:59.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才会离家出走的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.33,0:07:02.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再废话了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.59,0:07:04.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么话快说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.16,0:07:05.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底是为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.83,0:07:06.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么都没…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.10,0:07:09.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的是这个样子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.53,0:07:10.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.47,0:07:14.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们大家手捂着胸口 好好反省一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.47,0:07:18.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是真的从来没有做过对不起云母的事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.28,0:07:19.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们当中有谁谁敢这样断言
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.28,0:07:25.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以发誓我没有
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.35,0:07:28.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想不起来曾经做过什么事…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.12,0:07:30.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就没办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.19,0:07:33.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们对云母做过哪些过分的事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.43,0:07:37.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天就让我一件件说给你们听吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.36,0:07:39.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首先是犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:40.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.13,0:07:43.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那一次犬夜叉为了学会爆破流技术
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.30,0:07:47.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让云母陪他一起练风之伤对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.94,0:07:49.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,练风之伤那一次啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.60,0:08:18.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.54,0:08:23.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.11,0:08:30.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 要不要紧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.42,0:08:33.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.29,0:08:36.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,秃掉了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.83,0:08:42.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃…这个自然自己就会好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.16,0:08:47.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要紧不要紧啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.40,0:08:51.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来来 吃饭吃饭了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.70,0:08:54.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看见了 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.91,0:08:56.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的有这回事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.21,0:09:00.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想起来了 那阵子的确有这么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.58,0:09:02.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你以为可以这样神不知鬼不觉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.58,0:09:03.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就错了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.08,0:09:05.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母离家出走一定是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.19,0:09:09.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉！都是你害的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.09,0:09:11.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦咦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.59,0:09:13.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是这么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.56,0:09:16.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来云母的秃头是你造成的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.33,0:09:18.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说来 云母…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.33,0:09:20.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.07,0:09:24.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不能这样就断定云母离家出走跟我有关
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.34,0:09:26.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更何况这件事情已经发生那么久了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.94,0:09:28.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母一定早就忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.74,0:09:31.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道还会有其他原因吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.24,0:09:34.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样说不定真的有喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.11,0:09:38.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 你可别说你也忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.62,0:09:39.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.25,0:09:41.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.99,0:09:50.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 村子里有好多年轻小姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.63,0:09:54.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这下子云母可以派上用场了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.14,0:09:58.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.51,0:10:03.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪来的小猫 好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.38,0:10:08.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只猫叫作云母
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.11,0:10:11.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我养的宠物猫呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.52,0:10:12.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.75,0:10:15.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们几位姑娘也是一样可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.52,0:10:17.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 法师你真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.79,0:10:20.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不只这样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.66,0:10:26.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 你就是上次那位法师大人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.03,0:10:29.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天晚上你一定要留在村子里过夜哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.03,0:10:34.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请到我家里来吧 到我家怎样啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.17,0:10:36.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 又该云母上场了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.41,0:10:38.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.78,0:10:45.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶灵 退散
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.55,0:10:49.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看见了 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.19,0:10:51.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太…太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.56,0:10:53.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 你这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.06,0:10:56.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 不是啦 这是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.79,0:10:58.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 真是伤脑筋耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.80,0:11:00.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母它是我们的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.30,0:11:03.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们居然当它是道具一样使用方便
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.57,0:11:05.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后不可以再有这样的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.30,0:11:06.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.21,0:11:09.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你就从没当云母是道具一样使用方便吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.84,0:11:12.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦？咦咦…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:27.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.73,0:11:30.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 到底什么事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.60,0:11:31.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.86,0:11:33.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道又要什么“考试”啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.46,0:11:34.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,考试？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.97,0:11:36.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是这个啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.10,0:11:37.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.20,0:11:40.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 有了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.24,0:11:44.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的好舒服啊 拜托你了 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.11,0:11:46.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.48,0:11:48.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你肯帮我完成心愿的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.11,0:11:51.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就请你吃比目鱼跟鲔鱼口味的猫罐头
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.35,0:11:53.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好不好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.59,0:11:59.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看见了 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.76,0:12:01.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过那次
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.99,0:12:03.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底回家干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.03,0:12:05.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那次啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.27,0:12:11.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样 不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.90,0:12:13.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦你在这边等我一下下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.64,0:12:15.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很快就会回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.14,0:12:19.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 你一定要等我喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.15,0:12:28.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看这样 大家先来切蛋糕好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.25,0:12:31.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 那就先来切蛋糕吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.29,0:12:32.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.42,0:12:35.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷 祝你生日快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.89,0:12:36.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你啊 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.16,0:12:39.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你果然赶回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.53,0:12:41.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么犬夜叉哥哥没跟你一起回来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.30,0:12:44.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 爷爷 这是送给你的生日礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.14,0:12:47.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呜喔 这个是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.31,0:12:48.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不是很清楚它的来源啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.94,0:12:52.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过这个跟河童的手不一样 如假包换的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.18,0:12:53.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天能不能多留一下下呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.58,0:12:55.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.68,0:12:57.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为难得爷爷过生日
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.95,0:12:59.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少大家一起吃个饭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.55,0:13:00.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赞成
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.95,0:13:02.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为难得爷爷过生日嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.29,0:13:04.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为难得嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.82,0:13:08.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为难得嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.56,0:13:10.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为难得嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.57,0:13:17.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且 答应云母带罐头回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.70,0:13:19.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也忘得一干二净了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.67,0:13:20.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连戈薇也这样…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.44,0:13:23.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那…那是因为…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.98,0:13:25.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这几个坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.21,0:13:28.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后不准你们再虐待可爱的小妖怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.45,0:13:30.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.95,0:13:31.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.12,0:13:33.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后如果你再敢用拳头
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.12,0:13:35.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打我任何一拳的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.72,0:13:38.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就罚你整整一个礼拜都不准吃忍者餐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.32,0:13:39.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去 别自己订罚则
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.09,0:13:42.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.23,0:13:48.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 你千万不要误会 我们只不过是…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.33,0:13:50.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很对不起 我…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.24,0:13:53.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实我并没有恶意的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.01,0:13:54.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.37,0:13:57.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实 我又有什么立场指责你们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.24,0:13:59.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别这么说嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.48,0:14:00.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你们没什么不同
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.38,0:14:02.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚上睡不着的时候 心烦意乱的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.25,0:14:06.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都会叫云母带我飞过午夜的山岭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.52,0:14:09.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些真的没什么大不了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.49,0:14:11.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才过分呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.66,0:14:14.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,炉火升不起来的时候 我就叫云母变身
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.89,0:14:17.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有的时候 一天里面好几次让它去冒险
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:19.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它明明睡着了 我却捏它的鼻子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.26,0:14:21.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了好玩 还要它陪我玩变装游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.73,0:14:24.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿…戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.27,0:14:29.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们几个几乎一点都不疼它
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.64,0:14:31.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们简直坏透了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.81,0:15:01.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是个愚蠢的人类
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.82,0:15:05.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的以为能够平安穿过我的势力范围吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.79,0:15:07.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救…救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.46,0:15:08.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.96,0:15:11.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这座森林实在太缺食物了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.60,0:15:15.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.20,0:15:17.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为是云母呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.07,0:15:20.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然是一只狒狒妖怪再加上个大叔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.35,0:15:35.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 大叔 快点走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.32,0:15:39.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又…又是个妖怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.49,0:15:41.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.36,0:15:42.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.86,0:15:43.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好大的胆子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.86,0:15:44.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然敢放走我的猎物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.63,0:15:48.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.86,0:15:49.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.86,0:15:50.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.10,0:15:51.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.13,0:15:52.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没看见
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.33,0:15:55.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 我确实闻到了云母的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.50,0:15:56.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么多个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:15:58.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那一个一个来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.87,0:15:59.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那…那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.01,0:16:03.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我送给云母的丝巾
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.52,0:16:08.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不只是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.65,0:16:09.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.85,0:16:12.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,森林里到处都是动物的骸骨
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:18.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊…难道是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.86,0:16:23.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死妖怪！你把云母给吃了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.90,0:16:25.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你笨蛋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.03,0:16:27.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我吃的动物这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.90,0:16:29.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪还记得吃过谁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.14,0:16:32.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说真的是你吃的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.91,0:16:35.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用太难过
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.31,0:16:36.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们很快就可以见面了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.51,0:16:40.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上进我的肚子来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.88,0:16:45.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.56,0:16:51.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整座森林都是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.19,0:16:54.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,森林里的一切全都归我管
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.70,0:16:55.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,危险
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.93,0:16:59.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,速度太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.30,0:17:01.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利用树枝的反作用力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.94,0:17:02.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后灵活进行快速移动
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.20,0:17:03.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.94,0:17:06.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从绝对有利的制高点进行攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.34,0:17:09.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚妖怪说的话 也不全是吓唬我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.04,0:17:12.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个时候要是云母在就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.88,0:17:21.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它叫云母？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.88,0:17:22.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.04,0:17:25.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后要靠你照顾它了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.65,0:18:02.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.06,0:18:10.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过是只慌张得到处乱窜的杂碎妖怪嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.36,0:18:12.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你这种家伙我一下就…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.13,0:18:16.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不放过你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.43,0:18:17.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要替云母报仇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.68,0:18:32.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.68,0:18:35.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就凭这种打断树枝的本事也想要跟我斗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.88,0:19:07.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.72,0:19:12.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们能更重视一点云母的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.29,0:19:16.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母已经… 呜呜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.76,0:19:20.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊…！ 你…你…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.39,0:19:21.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喔哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.63,0:19:23.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.80,0:19:25.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.63,0:19:27.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来你平安无事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.14,0:19:28.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.51,0:19:36.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.91,0:19:39.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.26,0:19:51.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 害我们担心死了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.26,0:19:53.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.03,0:19:55.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.97,0:20:08.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是好久不见了 犬夜叉少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.78,0:20:09.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冥加爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.28,0:20:11.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么会在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.28,0:20:13.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是刀刀斋吩咐我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.95,0:20:17.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带一块磨刀石来给犬夜叉少爷磨铁碎牙的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.22,0:20:18.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,磨刀石？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.22,0:20:21.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么把这么重的东西搬来的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.56,0:20:23.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛 不是很简单吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.72,0:20:25.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我拜托云母帮我搬来的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.23,0:20:29.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是专程到这来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.83,0:20:31.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骑在云母身上回到刀刀斋那
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.87,0:20:33.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着马上再赶回来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.53,0:20:35.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一把老骨头差点没散掉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.97,0:20:39.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母 好久不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.07,0:20:42.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然来找你 想请你帮个忙行不行
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.58,0:20:45.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干什么 半夜三更叫什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.08,0:20:48.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 我要云母帮我点忙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.35,0:20:50.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得帮我跟犬夜叉他们说一声
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.32,0:20:55.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要一天的功夫就能赶回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.32,0:20:57.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.56,0:21:00.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这么说来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.59,0:21:01.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那条丝巾是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.00,0:21:03.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那条丝巾啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.60,0:21:11.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.04,0:21:14.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有时间在这儿逗留玩耍哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.35,0:21:24.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整件事就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.57,0:21:30.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.77,0:21:34.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事我…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.74,0:21:37.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概…也许…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.85,0:21:40.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我睡得太熟所以忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.12,0:21:43.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么你睡得太熟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.12,0:21:46.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最好给我觉悟了 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.35,0:21:49.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救救我啊 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.12,0:21:49.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.09,0:21:53.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见好就收吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.53,0:21:54.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听见了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.63,0:21:56.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.86,0:21:58.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.53,0:22:01.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别跑 七宝 不要嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.39,0:22:13.82,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红红的太阳照亮一切{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.60,0:22:23.77,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也照遍过去和现在
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.87,0:22:33.08,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些夕阳下的想象
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.38,0:22:42.85,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这颗心真的能承担吗{\fad(0,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.62,0:22:47.82,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我什么办法才能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.16,0:22:52.62,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过得比以前更开朗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.90,0:23:00.14,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么做就算会让自己委屈{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.14,0:23:06.44,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}默默承受伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.85,0:23:11.11,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会失去一切
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.42,0:23:18.29,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌仍会不断在我心中回荡{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.83,0:23:27.89,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌才是我的路标{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.80,0:23:50.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桔梗…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.17,0:23:52.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你哪里不舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.51,0:23:53.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快一起离开这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.21,0:23:54.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.24,0:23:57.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经失去了死魂 你别理我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.98,0:23:58.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果只有你一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.25,0:24:00.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说不定还有机会活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.98,0:24:02.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别那么容易放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.52,0:24:03.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果想要离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.75,0:24:04.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一定要同心协力才行
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.75,0:24:07.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.19,0:24:10.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山洞里只有桔梗跟戈薇两人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.49,0:24:13.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一股充满血气的温暖
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.93,0:24:17.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道这就是戈薇的坚强吗
